cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "Swarm CTDE: How Much Should a Centralized Critic See?"
abstract: >-
  Research code for a controlled study of critic observability in centralized
  training with decentralized execution (CTDE). The number of teammates visible
  to a MAPPO centralized critic is swept as an independent variable on a vertical
  quadrotor chain coupled by aerodynamic downwash and stochastic gusts, with
  actor, critic capacity, sample budget and evaluation episodes held fixed.
authors:
